### All tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks

### One task
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/1

### Create a task (expect 201 + Location header)
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn REST",
  "description": "Finish Tuesday's lab",
  "complete": false,
  "dueDate": "2026-11-20"
}

### Validation failure: expect 400 "title must not be blank"
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": " ", "complete": false }

### Broken JSON: expect 400
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "oops"

### Missing Content-Type: expect 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks

{ "title": "No content type" }

### Not found: expect 404
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/999

### Wrong id type: expect 400
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/abc

### Update (PUT replaces the whole task)
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Updated title", "description": "", "complete": true, "dueDate": null }

### Wrong method on an existing route: expect 405
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks/1

### Delete: expect 204, then 404 on a second try
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/2
